<newsitem itemid="65935" id="root" date="1996-09-19" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: Stime Watch declares 1st interim results.</title>
<headline>Stime Watch declares 1st interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 17.14</p>
<p>Dividend (H.K. cents)  3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	4.45 gain</p>
<p>    Net			  22.28</p>
<p>    Turnover		   175.89</p>
<p>    Company name	     Stime Watch International Holding Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		October 14-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 October 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Watch maker Stime Watch was listed on the Stock Exchange on July 23, 1996.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonue issue of one 1998 warrant for five shares held, each warrant will entitle the holder thereof to subscribe in cash at an initial subscription price of HK$1.35 from November 1, 1996 to December 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of a residential leasehold land and buildings situated in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
